WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.100
Two findings, and both were upstream.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.100
The wrong page gives you silence or a lie.

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.300
Linear had a features page. We never read it.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.300
A setup guide held the slot.

5
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.600
Docs answer a different question.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.900
Only the front page answers ours.

7
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.500
Then it was read. Eight capabilities.

8
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.300
That page had been there for four runs.

9
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.900
Todoist was read in Czech and Danish.

10
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.700
Two slots, one page, neither in English.

11
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:41.200
Dropping them would have been wrong.

12
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.000
Some sites publish in one language only.

13
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.700
And two slots went to steps in buying.

14
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:52.000
A page you act on states nothing.

15
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.900
Eight sources became three.

16
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.100
Three we can read beats eight we cannot.
